    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31279" root="عيم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِيمَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>choice,</i> or <i>best,</i> or <i>excellent,</i> (Az, S,
K, TA,) of camels or cattle or other property, (S,
K, TA,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِيفَةٌ</span>, (O and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عيف</span>,) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِينَةٌ</span>, (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عين</span>,) or, accord. to Az, <i>of anything:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِيَمٌ</span> (TA.)

